$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=radfib  LOC_AFTER=?

* The harmonic mass of the integers j <_ X coprime to F whose radical is the squarefree D is at most 1 / phi ( D ) (Lean fiber_inv_sum_le).

s1::progfib |- ( ( X e. NN /\ ( D e. NN /\ ( mmu ` D ) =/= 0 ) ) -> sum_ w e. ( 1 ... X ) if ( prod_ e e. { u e. Prime | u || w } e = D , ( 1 / w ) , 0 ) <_ ( ( 1 / D ) x. prod_ q e. { r e. Prime | r || D } ( 1 / ( 1 - ( 1 / q ) ) ) ) )
s2::simprl |- ( ( X e. NN /\ ( D e. NN /\ ( mmu ` D ) =/= 0 ) ) -> D e. NN )
i3::phiinvpf
s4:s2,i3:syl |- ( ( X e. NN /\ ( D e. NN /\ ( mmu ` D ) =/= 0 ) ) -> ( ( 1 / D ) x. prod_ q e. { r e. Prime | r || D } ( 1 / ( 1 - ( 1 / q ) ) ) ) = ( 1 / ( phi ` D ) ) )
s5:s1,s4:breqtrd |- ( ( X e. NN /\ ( D e. NN /\ ( mmu ` D ) =/= 0 ) ) -> sum_ w e. ( 1 ... X ) if ( prod_ e e. { u e. Prime | u || w } e = D , ( 1 / w ) , 0 ) <_ ( 1 / ( phi ` D ) ) )
s6::simpr |- ( ( ( X e. NN /\ ( D e. NN /\ ( mmu ` D ) =/= 0 ) ) /\ w e. ( 1 ... X ) ) -> w e. ( 1 ... X ) )
